{"title": "It Wasn't Nowhere", "type": "Trading mistake", "hooks": ["You did everything right, and then the price dropped out of nowhere.", "Nobody tells you the surprise drop was on the calendar.", "Stop trading blind. Check the calendar first."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Stop trading blind. Check the calendar first.", "text": "Out of nowhere?", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "It feels random", "show": 71, "vo": "A drop like this feels random. But often it isn't. It's a scheduled release.", "cues": [{"say": "A drop like this", "do": "reveal", "to": 87}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "cards", "head": "On the calendar", "vo": "Inflation, jobs, interest rates and earnings. Each one arrives on a set date.", "items": [{"text": "Inflation", "sub": "A scheduled release", "icon": "chart"}, {"text": "Jobs", "sub": "A scheduled release", "icon": "people"}, {"text": "Interest rates", "sub": "Rate decisions", "icon": "coin"}, {"text": "Earnings", "sub": "Company results", "icon": "clock"}], "cues": [{"say": "Inflation", "do": "item", "i": 0}, {"say": "jobs", "do": "item", "i": 1}, {"say": "interest rates", "do": "item", "i": 2}, {"say": "earnings", "do": "item", "i": 3}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "big", "text": "The surprise moves price", "vo": "And it's the surprise against the forecast that moves the price.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "cards", "head": "Practise it here", "vo": "Meme Street has an economy calendar with forecasts, earnings every couple of days, and a live news wire.", "items": [{"text": "Economy calendar", "sub": "Each release has a forecast", "icon": "clock"}, {"text": "Earnings", "sub": "Every couple of days", "icon": "coin"}, {"text": "Live news wire", "sub": "Headlines as they land", "icon": "bolt"}], "cues": [{"say": "an economy calendar", "do": "item", "i": 0}, {"say": "earnings every couple of days", "do": "item", "i": 1}, {"say": "a live news wire", "do": "item", "i": 2}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Check the calendar first", "vo": "Check the calendar before you trade. Practise trading the news at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "You did everything right, and then the price dropped out of nowhere.\n\nUsually it wasn't nowhere. It was a scheduled release: inflation, jobs, rates or earnings.\nIt is the surprise against the forecast that moves the price.\nMeme Street has an economy calendar with forecasts, earnings every couple of days and a live news wire.\n\nFollow for more beginner lessons.\nPractise at memestreet.net\n\nFictional market. Not investment advice.\n\n#MemeStreet #EconomicCalendar #Earnings #LearnToTrade", "charts": [{"candles": [[45.68, 45.85, 44.31, 44.34, 39461], [44.35, 44.44, 43.35, 43.53, 116335], [43.5, 43.81, 43.08, 43.54, 55015], [43.54, 44.21, 42.94, 43.88, 89965], [43.87, 46.65, 43.25, 46.55, 71110], [46.54, 46.62, 46.11, 46.27, 31769], [46.27, 46.54, 45.23, 45.24, 40552], [45.24, 45.97, 45.09, 45.5, 103154], [45.53, 46.23, 45.12, 45.44, 97302], [45.43, 47.08, 44.73, 45.3, 323901], [45.33, 46.24, 44.36, 45.28, 184631], [45.28, 47.61, 44.74, 45.09, 438179], [45.12, 45.17, 43.6, 44.02, 159156], [44.02, 44.07, 42.65, 43.64, 68337], [43.64, 43.65, 43.16, 43.38, 51075], [43.37, 44.39, 43.28, 44.3, 66255], [44.3, 44.31, 43.52, 44.03, 74031], [44.04, 44.2, 43.09, 43.28, 77192], [43.29, 43.92, 43.27, 43.42, 37748], [43.42, 44.04, 43.35, 43.98, 59241], [43.99, 44.33, 43.93, 44.0, 66612], [44.0, 44.12, 42.59, 43.3, 74444], [43.31, 43.75, 43.26, 43.72, 40234], [43.72, 43.99, 42.21, 43.05, 57485], [43.04, 43.76, 42.96, 43.63, 42514], [43.63, 43.89, 43.26, 43.56, 44215], [43.57, 44.22, 43.25, 44.02, 107919], [44.04, 44.53, 43.8, 43.9, 88081], [43.9, 43.97, 43.31, 43.35, 46108], [43.34, 43.42, 41.76, 41.96, 229668], [41.93, 43.32, 41.82, 42.85, 86782], [42.84, 43.31, 42.79, 43.2, 42692], [43.19, 43.74, 43.17, 43.65, 23712], [43.66, 43.8, 43.5, 43.55, 24015], [43.55, 43.64, 43.51, 43.59, 30398], [43.59, 44.05, 43.59, 